2 CONC ough=6000000043494145309 (b. ca 5 BC). Fundanius' daughter Fundania (b. ca 20) married Galerius (b. ca 15), a Praetor, son of Gaius Galerius (ca 15 BC - aft. 23), Praefectus Aeg. in 23, and had Galeria Fundana, second wife of http
2 CONC s://www.geni.com/people/Vitellius-Roman-Emperor/6000000006964073251?through=6000000011350106657. His maternal grandparents were Lucius Aelius Plautius Lamia Aelianus and wife Domitia Longina. He married Annia (b. ca 93), daughter 
2 CONC of Marcus Annius Verus and wife Rupilia Faustina, and had Lucius Plautius Lamia Silvanus.''''''
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''
2 CONT =Lucius Fundanius Lamia Aelianus=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucius Fundanius Lamia Aelianus (ca 83 - 132/136) was a consul in 116 and a proconsul in 131-132.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Lucius Fundanius (b. ca 55) and wife Plautia (b. ca 65/ca 70), paternal grandson of Lucius Fundanius (b. ca 25), and great-grandson of Fundanius (b. ca 5 BC). Fundanius' daughter Fundania (b. ca 20) married Galer
2 CONC ius (b. ca 15), a Praetor, son of Gaius Galerius (ca 15 BC - aft. 23), Praefectus Aeg. in 23, and had Galeria Fundana, second wife of Vitellius. His maternal grandparents were Lucius Aelius Lamia Plautius Aelianus and wife Domitia
2 CONC  Longina. He married Annia (b. ca 93), daughter of Marcus Annius Verus and wife Rupilia Faustina, and had Lucius Plautius Lamia Silvanus.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Fundanius_Lamia_Aelianus
