1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Wikipedia: 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titus_Flavius_Sabinus_(consul_82&#41 Titus Flavius Sabinus]''', son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Titus-Flavius-Sabinus/6000000005379570072 Titus Flavius Sabinus] (consul 69) and brother to [http:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/people/Titus-Flavius-Clemens/6000000009144745200 Titus Flavius Clemens], was consul of the Roman Empire in 82. He married his paternal second cousin [http://www.geni.com/people/Julia-Flavia/6000000005378117944 Julia
2 CONC  Flavia].
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Tacitus, ''Histories''
2 CONT * Suetonius, ''Lives of the Twelve Caesars''
2 CONT * Cassius Dio, ''Roman History''
2 CONT * Arnold Blumberg (ed) (1995), ''Great Leaders, Great Tyrants?: Contemporary Views of World Rulers Who Made History''
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=jdp-fam&id=I66432
2 CONT
