1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaius_Claudius
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''
2 CONT =Gaius Claudius Centho=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Gaius Claudius Centho or Cento was a 3rd-century BC member of a prominent and wealthy patrician Roman Republic family. He was the third son of Appius Claudius Caecus, and a member of the Claudii. He was consul in the year 240 BC. 
2 CONC He was Roman censor in 225, interrex in 217 and Roman dictator in 213.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaius_Claudius_Centho
