2 CONT ''The Rise the Romans: The Rise and Fall of the Roman Empire, a Chronology, Vol. 1 753 BC-146 BC''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Page 118 snippet''':  "As the consuls Gaius Plautius Venox and Lucius Aemilius Mamercinus Privernas entered office, Rome found herself compelled to seek a settlement with the Samnites, and effectively abandoned her Campanian al
2 CONC lies to deal with the problem posed by the Lains. Northern campania remained under Roman occupation after Aemilius concluded the ,,."  
